  <office:body>
    <office:text>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">避難者カード【ネパール】</text:p>
      <text:p>उदाहरण　　　　　　　　　शिविर कार्ड (अगाडिको भाग)　　　　　　　　　【様式一7】</text:p>
      <text:p>मिति　 साल　 महिना　 दिन　 कृपया प्रत्येक घरको लागि सूची बनाउनुहोस्।</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="FrontForm" table:style-name="FormTable">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColA"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColB"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColC"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColD"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColE"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColF"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>शिविर मिति र समय</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>साल　　 महिना　　 दिन　　 समय</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:number-rows-spanned="3" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>समूह－ नम्बर.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">―</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>शिविर केन्द्र</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>निकासस्थल ・ घर ・ क्षेत्र （　　　　　　　　　　　）</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Small">※गाडीमा बसोबास गर्नेहरूले, कृपया पार्किङको स्थान लेख्नुहोस्।</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>छिमेकी संघको नाम</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>※ बासिन्दा संघमा सामेल नभएकाहरूले “सामेल नभएको” भनेर लेख्नुहोस्।</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>शिविरमा भएको कितलाई गोलो लगाउनुहोस्</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="TableHead">कतागाना नाम</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="TableHead">उमेर</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="TableHead">लिंग</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="TableHead">नाता</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Bold">नोट※ विशेष हेरचाह आवश्यक पर्ने व्यक्तिको संख्या वर्णन गर्नुहोस्</text:p></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>(मुख्य व्यक्ति)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>　वर्ष</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">पुरुष ・ महिला ・ अन्य</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>　वर्ष</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">पुरुष ・ महिला ・ अन्य</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>　वर्ष</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">पुरुष ・ महिला ・ अन्य</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>　वर्ष</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">पुरुष ・ महिला ・ अन्य</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>　वर्ष</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">पुरुष ・ महिला ・ अन्य</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="TableHead">ठेगाना</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>〒</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="TableHead">घर मुलिको नम्बर</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>（　　　　　　）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="TableHead">घर पालुवा जनावर</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>छ　・　छैन　　※छ भने घरपालुवा जनावर फारम भर्नुहोस्।</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>विशेष हेरचाह आवश्यक पर्ने व्यक्तिहरू ※सम्बन्धित व्यक्तिको नम्बर</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>1 गर्भवती महिला,　2 शिशु,　3 अपाङ्गता भएका व्यक्तिहरू（　　　　　　　　　）</text:p><text:p>4 दीर्घकालीन हेरचाह प्राप्तकर्ताहरू</text:p><text:p>5 मेडिकल उपकरण प्रयोगकर्ताहरू（　　　　　　　　）</text:p><text:p>6 एलर्जी（　　　　　）　7 विदेशी नागरिक(देशको नाम　　　　　　)</text:p><text:p>8 अन्य（　　　　　　　　　）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p>※　विशेष ध्यान चाहिने व्यक्तिहरू हुन् जसलाई शिविर जीवनको लागि विशेष हेरचाह आवश्यक पर्दछ, जस्तै गर्भवती महिला, शिशुहरू, र अपाङ्गता भएका व्यक्तिहरू।</text:p>
      <text:p>शिविर कार्ड (पछाडिको भाग)　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　【様式一7】</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Bold">पछाडिको विवरण स्थिति ठीक भएपछी भर्नुहोस्।</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="PageBreak"/>
      <table:table table:name="BackForm" table:style-name="FormTable">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColA"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColB"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColC"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColD"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColE"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="ColF"/>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="6" table:style-name="HeavyCell"><text:p text:style-name="Bold">सुरक्षा पुष्टिको लागि जानकारीको खुलासा (चाहिनेछ” वा चाहिँदैन ”मा गोलो लगाउनुहोस्)</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>के तपाईं वेबसाइट वा मिडिया मार्फत उद्धारकर्ताहरूको जानकारी खुलासा गर्न चाहनुहुन्छ?</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">चाहनुहुन्छ / चाहँदैन</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>के तपाईं आफन्तहरू, घरका साथीहरू, र परिचितहरूबाट सुरक्षा सोधपुछको जवाफमा विस्थापित जानकारी प्रदान गर्न चाहनुहुन्छ?</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">चाहनुहुन्छ / चाहँदैन</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-rows-spanned="3" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Bold">आवास क्षति *कृपया क्षति भएका सबै वस्तुहरू गोलो लगाउनुहोस्</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>छ / छैन　*यदि “छ” भने, कृपया घरको क्षतिको अवस्थालाई विस्तृत रूपमा वर्णन गर्नुहोस्।</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>※वर्णन उदाहरण</text:p><text:p>・ घर भत्किएको छ र अहिले बस्न सक्ने अवस्थामा छैन।</text:p><text:p>　　・ कोठा सफा गर्‍यौं भने, आफ्नो घर फर्कन सक्नुहुन्छ</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>बत्ती बन्द,　 पानी बन्द,　 ग्यास बन्द,　 टेलिफोन अवरोध</text:p><text:p>अर्को（　　　　　　　　　）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="6" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Bold">पीडितको जानकारी</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="6" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>कृपया तपाईंको नाम र तपाईंको चोट वा रोगको विस्तृत स्थिति बारे बताउनुहोस्।</text:p><text:p> </text:p><text:p> </text:p><text:p> </text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Bold">शिविर （स्थानान्तरण गन्तव्य）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Bold">शिविरबारे जानकारी （शिविरको ठेगाना）</text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
        <table:table-row>
          <table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="6" table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>अन्य विशेष नोट (यदि आफैँका पास योग्यता छ और आप सहयोग कर सकते हैं, तो कृपया अपना नाम और सामग्री दर्ज करें।)</text:p><text:p> </text:p><text:p> </text:p><text:p> </text:p></table:table-cell>
          <table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/>
        </table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p>〈शिविर संचालन समितिले भर्ने विवरण〉</text:p>
